# Files listed here will NOT be overwritten by swagger-codegen / openapi-generator
# when the SDK is regenerated from the swagger spec. Each section below
# documents WHY the file diverges from the generator's output, so a future
# maintainer can decide whether the hand-edit is still needed (i.e. whether
# the upstream swagger has caught up to reality).
#
# Re-evaluate every entry whenever the swagger spec is updated.

