# P81-123406 / BUG-17 — Object Service protocols
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# The swagger declares ObjectServiceProtocolTCPUDP as a `oneOf` over
# Single/Range/List, and wraps it again in `anyOf(TCPUDP, ICMPResponse)`
# for ObjectsServicesProtocolResponseObj/RequestObj. The public-api at
# perimeter81-public-api/src/api/interceptors/services/services.interceptor.ts
# actually emits a single flat object per protocol entry:
#   { protocol, valueType, value }                  for tcp/udp
#   { protocol, protocolOptions }                   for icmp
# The codegen's nested wrapper types cannot be populated from the flat
# wire payload (the inner pointers stay nil after Unmarshal), so we
# replaced them with plain structs that match the wire shape.
#
# If a future swagger update flattens those schemas itself, remove the
# entries below and let codegen regenerate normally.
