# P81-123406 / BUG-25 — Sparse enhanced-health meta on wire
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# The swagger declares all four EnhancedHealthCheckMeta fields (networkId,
# tunnelName, tunnelId, regionId) as required, but the public-api only
# emits networkId + tunnelName for tunnels that haven't completed an
# initial health probe yet (status="unknown"). The generated
# UnmarshalJSON strict-checks the full required list and rejects sparse
# wire payloads with `no value given for required property tunnelId`.
# We trim the required list to the two always-present fields; tunnelId /
# regionId fall back to "" when the wire omits them.
#
# If a future swagger update marks tunnelId/regionId optional (or wraps
# them in a nullable type), drop this entry and let codegen regenerate.
